This package uses Tencent/openclaw-weixin as the iLink protocol reference:
https://github.com/Tencent/openclaw-weixin

src/vendor/tencent-weixin contains a minimal TypeScript adaptation of the
AES-128-ECB, CDN key encoding and download URL rules from
@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin 2.4.10, Copyright (C) 2026 Tencent.
The complete Tencent MIT license and source digests/modifications are shipped
at src/vendor/tencent-weixin/LICENSE and SOURCES.md. No upstream plugin is
installed or loaded by this package.

The remaining repository code retains its own MIT license in LICENSE.
WeChat, Tencent, DeepSeek and OpenClaw names identify their respective products.
